From: James Trotter <james@jamesat.dev>
Date: Thu, 26 Nov 2026 16:16:28 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] api: add /v1/account_disconnect

Disconnects every client logged into an account (always-on clients
included) and turns always-on off for it, so an account disabled in an
external account system (a banned federated user in the boson stack)
leaves at once and doesn't come back at a restart. The account and its
channels are kept.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
